msgid ""
"## 注意事项\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## Precautions\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 脚本会通过 `torch_npu` 自动识别 NPU 环境；如需手动指定，设置 `DEVICE=npu`。\n"
"- Qwen3.5 的 Gated Delta Net 当前不使用 packed sequence，因此脚本中保持 `use_remove_padding=False` 和 `use_dynamic_bsz=False`。\n"
"- NPU 分支会设置 `vanilla_mbridge=False`、`use_flash_attn=True`、`moe_token_dispatcher_type=alltoall` 等 Ascend 适配参数。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- The script automatically detects the NPU environment using `torch_npu`; to specify it manually, set `DEVICE=npu`.\n"
"- The Gated Delta Net of Qwen3.5 currently does not use packed sequence, so the script keeps `use_remove_padding=False` and `use_dynamic_bsz=False`.\n"
"- The NPU branch sets `vanilla_mbridge=False`, `use_flash_attn=True`, `moe_token_dispatcher_type=alltoall`, and other Ascend adaptation parameters.\n"
""
